# Purpose
Guides users through common data cleanup tasks such as headers, dates, numbers,
duplicates, and consistency checks.

# Key Sections
- Before cleaning data.
- Common cleanup tasks.
- Column headers.
- Dates.
- Numbers and amounts.
- Duplicate records.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Cleanup should preserve source data or note reversible steps when possible.

